|     `-ParenExpr 'int' lvalue
|       `-DeclRefExpr 'int' lvalue Var 'g' 'int'
|-VarDecl amb_ta 'C' callinit
| `-ParenExpr 'C'
|   `-CXXFunctionalCastExpr 'C' functional cast to C <ConstructorConversion>
|     `-CXXConstructExpr 'C' 'void (int)'
